  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She holds a dragonfish under lantern light, inspects it repeatedly, and places it in her immortal aperture. She is cautious, has many acquaintances, and notices people quickly. When Fang Yuan quietly raises his stock, she buys a batch, reads him as a huge foe, and fails to probe his will. After several days of rising pressure she leaves and takes an undercurrent to travel.",
      "chapters": [
        1471
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under the lantern, her beautiful face is solemn as she frowns.",
      "chapters": [
        1471
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is beautiful.",
      "chapters": [
        1472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "With Qin Bai He she has incredible elegance and is very attractive.",
      "chapters": [
        1486
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_he"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a lone cultivator with many connections, and one of the six publicly recognized great fairies in Eastern Sea. A Nan Gong clan rank six Gu Immortal welcomes her with respect because she is rank seven. She meets Hua An, one of Eastern Sea’s three wisdom path experts and a good friend, at Hua Qiao Pavilion.",
      "chapters": [
        1472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "nan-gong-visit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_nan_gong_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_hua_an",
        "house_hua_qiao_pavilion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By the time Fang Yuan breeds copper dragonfish, his prior dragonfish selling had already drawn a counterattack from her, and other Gu Immortals know he is in the business. He aims the copper dragonfish at her directly as his true trump card, waiting to see how she answers it.",
      "chapters": [
        1477
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-counterattack-and-a-trump-card-aimed-at-her",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She obtained a food path inheritance earlier, less authentic than Fang Yuan’s, and having it is why the dragonfish business is her main source of income. Seeing his copper dragonfish as a fundamental threat to that business, she uses one as a reference to reverse deduce her own, and half a month later she has recreated the new species for herself.",
      "chapters": [
        1478
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "racing-to-match-copper-dragonfish",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan traps her with Qin Bai He inside the immortal battlefield killer move purple star broken life, a dark red egg shell filled with purple stars. Qin Bai He is one of Eastern Sea’s six fairies, like You Chan. You Chan stands in front of Qin Bai He to defend while Qin Bai He tries fragrant flowery words. You Chan raises a rain shield of droplets and mist. Purple stars smash the rain and the flowers. She pushes her palms and gathers water threads into a huge fish monster, the immortal killer move Whale Form Rain. After purple stars wreck the fish, she sustains the move and replenishes it with rainwater. Ancient soul beasts ignore the fish and attack the two fairies directly.",
      "chapters": [
        1485
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "purple-star-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_whale_form_rain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The two refuse Fang Yuan’s terms and choose to fight to the death. When half of Qin Bai He’s body is torn, You Chan moves to help and is bit by the ancient sword dragon, unguarded. Fang Yuan chews and swallows. She turns into mushy flesh and blood and dies. Qin Bai He calls her Chan Er.",
      "chapters": [
        1486
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entering You Chan blessed land, whose acknowledgement requirement is to kill Fang Yuan, he goes in disguised and uses the killer move Blood Light Spirit Suppression to suppress her land spirit; the water path immortal aperture is annexed soon after.",
      "chapters": [
        1487
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-annexed-after-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_blood_light_spirit_suppression"
      ]
    }
  ],
